    "title": "'Survivor' 50 full cast, complete with two players from season 49",
    "text": "During Wednesday night's finale, we found out which players from season 49 took the final two spots on the \"Survivor\" 50 cast. FIJI, — With a new sole survivor officially crowned for season 49, fans across the U.S. are already setting their sights on the monumental \"Survivor\" 50. The first 22 names — a mix of old- and new-school players — on the \"Survivor\" 50 cast were announced back in May, with the final two spots going to mystery castaways from season 49. And during Wednesday night's finale, we found out who those two players were. Here's the \"Survivor\" 50 cast, complete with the two final \"Survivor\" 49 players. Survivor 50 cast Jenna Lewis-DoughertySeason 1 (Borneo) and 8 (All-Stars) Colby DonaldsonSeasons 2 (The Australian Outback), 8 (All-Stars) and 20 (Heroes vs. Villains) Stephenie LaGrossa KendrickSeasons 10 (Palau), 11 (Guatemala) and 20 (Heroes vs. Villains) Cirie FieldsSeasons 12 (Panama-Exile Island), 16 (Micronesia-Fans vs. Favorites), 20 (Heroes vs. Villains) and 34 (Game Changers) Ozzy LusthSeasons 13 (Cook Islands), 16 (Micronesia-Fans vs. Favorites), 23 (South Pacific) and 34 (Game Changers) Coach (Benjamin \"Coach\" Wade)Seasons 18 (Tocantins-The Brazilian Highlands), 20 (Heroes vs. Villains), 23 (South Pacific) Aubry BraccoSeasons 32 (Kaôh Rōng – Brains vs. Brawn vs. Beauty), 34 (Game Changers), 38 (Edge of Extinction) Chrissy HofbeckSeason 35 (Heroes vs. Healers vs. Hustlers) Christian HubickiSeason 37 (David vs. Goliath) Angelina KeeleySeason 37 (David vs. Goliath) Mike WhiteSeason 37 (David vs. Goliath) Rick DevensSeason 38 (Edge of Extinction) Jonathan YoungSeason 42 Dee ValladaresSeason 45 winner Emily FlippenSeason 45 Q Burdette Season 46 Tiffany Ervin Season 46 Charlie DavisSeason 46 Genevieve MushalukSeason 47 Kamilla Karthigesu Season 48 Kyle FraserSeason 48 winner Joe HunterSeason 48 Who won Survivor 49? Savannah Louie Savannah Louie beat out Sage Ahrens-Nichols and Sophi Balerdi to become the sole survivor of \"Survivor\" 49. Who from Survivor 49 is on the Survivor 50 cast? The sole survivor herself, \"Survivor\" 49 winner Savannah Louie, will be returning to Fiji for the show's legendary 50th season. Joining Savannah will be her strongest ally, the R-I-Z-G-O-D, Rizo Velovic. After getting eliminated in the fire-making stage of season 49, Rizo Velovic will get another chance to show off his strategic chops. When does Survivor 50 start? \"Survivor 50\" named \"In the Hands of the Fans,\" premieres on Wednesday, Feb. 25, 2026, with a special three-hour episode at 8 p.m. on CBS and Paramount+.",
